                    "type": "markdown",
                    "title": "Hiking around Arenal Volcano and relaxing in hot springs.",
                    "markdown": "We started our trip in La Fortuna, a small town located at the base of the Arenal Volcano. We spent our days hiking around the volcano and exploring the surrounding rainforest. We also took a dip in some of the natural hot springs that are heated by the volcano. It was a great way to relax after a long day of hiking."
